## 3. Restrictions — What You May Not Do

Unless you have the Licensor's **prior written permission**, you **must not**:

1. **Copy, reproduce, republish, repost, mirror, or otherwise reproduce** the
   Materials, in whole or in part, in any medium, whether modified or not.
2. **Distribute, sublicense, lease, rent, sell, resell, license, or otherwise
   transfer** the Materials, including via forks, mirrors, package registries,
   container registries, Docker Hub, PyPI, npm, Hugging Face, Model Hub, or any
   similar service.
3. **Host or operate** the Software, or any derivative of it, as a public or
   commercial service — including as a SaaS product, hosted demo, API
   endpoint, hosted notebook, or competitive product.
4. **Use the Software, in any form, in a commercial product or service**, or
   in any revenue-generating activity.
5. **Create, publish, or distribute a derivative work or fork** of the
   Software.
6. **Remove, alter, obscure, or circumvent** any copyright, trademark,
   attribution, license, or proprietary notice in the Materials.
7. **Use the Trademark Materials** — other than to accurately describe the
   Software, to link to the official repository, or to state factually that
   your Contribution was merged — including in your project name, domain
   name, logo, or product branding.
8. **Represent yourself** as the Licensor, an official maintainer, an
   authorized partner, or an official FinVerify distribution channel.
9. **Use the Software to build a competing product**, or to benchmark,
   train, fine-tune, evaluate, or otherwise derive models, datasets, weights,
   or artifacts from the Software for commercial purposes.
10. **Remove or disable** the cryptographic signing, canonicalization, or
    append-only ledger guarantees in order to disguise the provenance of
    output produced by the Software.

Any of the above requires a separate written agreement with the Licensor
(available on request). A public fork, a public mirror, or an unauthorized
copy constitutes a breach of this License.

